  Legend: control flow; next round; error containment; termination; analysis core
end note
note as s7-wording
  S7 is drawn as keep or invalidate q. CONFIRMED-NOT-SENT keeps q; UNKNOWN-EFFECT invalidates q. Only RECOVER is admissible after unknown-effect. confirmed not sent remains the method and Algorithm 1 wording. Two columns: left S0-S3 and S10 aligned with Terminal; right S4-S9.
